OL,3,GNEWSABelfast Telegraph bomb victim
OL,4,Aremembered on 50th anniversary
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis granddaughter Amanda Pollock said
OL,7,Fthe 50th anniversary of his death is a
OL,8,Freminder of how much grief and
OL,9,Fsuffering the Troubles caused during
OL,10,Fthree decades of violence.
